{"id":"44ad6dc46f3340f0","group":"58","path":"58/batch19/58-df-bound-variable.md","title":"Bound Variable","display":"df-bound-variable — Bound Variable","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-bound-variable","aliases":["58-df-bound-variable"],"display":"df-bound-variable — Bound Variable","depends_on":["[[58-df-formula]]","[[58-df-subformula]]","[[58-df-free-variable]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-bound-variable"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-bound-variable</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-bound-variable — Bound Variable"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"65418b505fc53093\" href=\"?note=65418b505fc53093\" title=\"58-df-formula\">58-df-formula</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"621985f38a386342\" href=\"?note=621985f38a386342\" title=\"58-df-subformula\">58-df-subformula</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"715a32e91161b34f\" href=\"?note=715a32e91161b34f\" title=\"58-df-free-variable\">58-df-free-variable</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma\">\\(\\Sigma\\)</span> (signature, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"65418b505fc53093\" href=\"?note=65418b505fc53093\" title=\"58-df-formula\">58-df-formula</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\Sigma)\">\\(\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\Sigma)\\)</span> (一阶公式集, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"65418b505fc53093\" href=\"?note=65418b505fc53093\" title=\"58-df-formula\">58-df-formula</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Sf}_\\Sigma(\\varphi)\">\\(\\mathrm{Sf}_\\Sigma(\\varphi)\\)</span> (子公式集, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"621985f38a386342\" href=\"?note=621985f38a386342\" title=\"58-df-subformula\">58-df-subformula</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi \\in \\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\Sigma)\">\\(\\varphi \\in \\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\Sigma)\\)</span> (公式)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x \\in \\mathrm{Var}_S\">\\(x \\in \\mathrm{Var}_S\\)</span> (变量, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"65418b505fc53093\" href=\"?note=65418b505fc53093\" title=\"58-df-formula\">58-df-formula</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\psi \\in \\mathrm{Sf}_\\Sigma(\\varphi)\">\\(\\psi \\in \\mathrm{Sf}_\\Sigma(\\varphi)\\)</span> (子公式)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\theta \\in \\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\Sigma)\">\\(\\theta \\in \\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\Sigma)\\)</span> (formula body)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{BV}_S:V^2\\to V\">\\(\\mathrm{BV}_S:V^2\\to V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV}_\\Sigma:\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\Sigma)\\to\\mathcal P(\\mathrm{Var}_S)\">\\(\\operatorname{FV}_\\Sigma:\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\Sigma)\\to\\mathcal P(\\mathrm{Var}_S)\\)</span> (free-variable operator, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"715a32e91161b34f\" href=\"?note=715a32e91161b34f\" title=\"58-df-free-variable\">58-df-free-variable</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}bound\\text{-}variable} \\vdash \\mathrm{BV}_S(\\Sigma,\\varphi)\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}\\{x\\in\\mathrm{Var}_S\\mid\\exists\\psi\\in\\mathrm{Sf}_\\Sigma(\\varphi)\\;\\exists\\theta\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\Sigma)\\;(\\psi=\\forall x\\,\\theta\\land x\\in\\operatorname{FV}_\\Sigma(\\theta))\\},&amp;\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\Sigma),\\\\ \\varnothing,&amp;\\varphi\\notin\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\Sigma).\\end{cases}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}bound\\text{-}variable} \\vdash \\mathrm{BV}_S(\\Sigma,\\varphi)\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}\\{x\\in\\mathrm{Var}_S\\mid\\exists\\psi\\in\\mathrm{Sf}_\\Sigma(\\varphi)\\;\\exists\\theta\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\Sigma)\\;(\\psi=\\forall x\\,\\theta\\land x\\in\\operatorname{FV}_\\Sigma(\\theta))\\},&amp;\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\Sigma),\\\\ \\varnothing,&amp;\\varphi\\notin\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\Sigma).\\end{cases}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x \\in \\mathrm{BV}_S(\\Sigma,\\varphi)\">\\(x \\in \\mathrm{BV}_S(\\Sigma,\\varphi)\\)</span> 表示 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi\">\\(\\varphi\\)</span> 中至少有一个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\">\\(x\\)</span> 的出现被量词绑定；空量词 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\forall x\\,\\theta\">\\(\\forall x\\,\\theta\\)</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\\notin\\operatorname{FV}_\\Sigma(\\theta)\">\\(x\\notin\\operatorname{FV}_\\Sigma(\\theta)\\)</span> 时不会凭空贡献约束出现。</li>\n<li>上游公式语法以 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\forall\">\\(\\forall\\)</span> 为原始量词；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\exists x\\,\\theta\">\\(\\exists x\\,\\theta\\)</span> 先展开为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\neg\\forall x\\,\\neg\\theta\">\\(\\neg\\forall x\\,\\neg\\theta\\)</span>，所以不需要另加一个与语法构造子不一致的分支。</li>\n<li>同一变量符号可在一个公式的不同出现处分别自由或受约束；自由/约束应按出现位置区分。</li>\n<li>通过 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\alpha\">\\(\\alpha\\)</span>-重命名可以避免变量捕获（capture）</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Related-Concepts\">[Related Concepts]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"65418b505fc53093\" href=\"?note=65418b505fc53093\" title=\"58-df-formula\">58-df-formula</a> — 一阶公式</li>\n<li><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"621985f38a386342\" href=\"?note=621985f38a386342\" title=\"58-df-subformula\">58-df-subformula</a> — 子公式</li>\n<li><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-11\" data-note=\"715a32e91161b34f\" href=\"?note=715a32e91161b34f\" title=\"58-df-free-variable\">58-df-free-variable</a> — 自由变元</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2},{"id":"Related-Concepts","text":"[Related Concepts]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-df-formula","status":"resolved","id":"65418b505fc53093","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-formula]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-subformula","status":"resolved","id":"621985f38a386342","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-subformula]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-free-variable","status":"resolved","id":"715a32e91161b34f","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-free-variable]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-formula","status":"resolved","id":"65418b505fc53093","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\Sigma$ (signature, see [[58-df-formula]])","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-formula","status":"resolved","id":"65418b505fc53093","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\Sigma)$ (一阶公式集, see [[58-df-formula]])","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-subformula","status":"resolved","id":"621985f38a386342","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Sf}_\\Sigma(\\varphi)$ (子公式集, see [[58-df-subformula]])","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-formula","status":"resolved","id":"65418b505fc53093","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$x \\in \\mathrm{Var}_S$ (变量, see [[58-df-formula]])","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-free-varia